## Title: Commander Quartermaster
## Author: Devin
## Version: 2.4.0
## Notes: The supply ledger — a browsable database of every TBC consumable and every item enhancement, with class/spec loadout recommendations, account-wide favorites, and tracking of what you hold across bags, bank, mail, and every alt. With Commander Orders, Ctrl+Right-click a row to go to where it comes from: the nearest auctioneer, vendor, trainer, dropper or quest giver.
